# Conformance probe pack (spec 0.34): an outer text that can fail before
# an `inner … partial` line. Public. No kinds.
format     conformance-inner-asciiheadpartial
version    0.34.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
field   probe.s1  8  ascii
inner   conformance-inner-fixed  partial
